            "uuid": "RationaleClaim_NonSafety_LightingIndication_HazardWarning_@db5ba348",
            "description": [
                "EL-HAZ-1.5 on LightingIndication is implied by EL-HAZ-1.5.1 and 1.5.2: the DIM lights the cluster turn telltales from TurnLightControl, and the GWM passes the same values on to the TurnlightIndicator SOME/IP service for the infotainment domain.",
                "",
                "IHU takes no part in EL-HAZ-1: the telltale is the operating indication, the infotainment mirror a convenience. The IHU_Lighting TurnlightControlEvent handler is a stub today, which this argument does not rely on.",
                "",
                "```mermaid",
                "flowchart LR",
                "  in[\"TurnLightControl\"] --> dim[\"DIM<br/>1.5.1 telltales\"]",
                "  in --> gwm[\"GWM<br/>1.5.2 publish\"]",
                "  gwm -->|\"TurnlightControlEvent\"| ihu[\"IHU<br/>not relied on\"]",
                "```"
            ],
            "name": "RationaleClaim_NonSafety_LightingIndication_HazardWarning",
